          <a href="#research">02 // Hardware &amp; Research</a>
          <a href="#trajectory">03 // Trajectory</a>
          <a href="#contact">Resume (PDF)</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/KshitijSawarkar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/kshitijas" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
