            <p class="stack"><strong>Operational Scope:</strong> Site acceptance testing (SAT), floor map calibration, obstacle avoidance triage, and sensor-to-middleware integration.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Pillar 02: Edge AI &amp; Low-Latency Vision</h3>
            <p><strong>Core Competencies:</strong> YOLOv5, OpenCV, Post-Training Quantization (INT8), ONNX Runtime Engine, Low-Latency Real-Time Inference, Edge Hardware Acceleration (ARM Cortex/RPi).</p>
            <p class="stack"><strong>Operational Scope:</strong> Deploying quantized detection models directly to edge nodes without cloud compute reliance.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Pillar 03: Customer Systems &amp; Floor Integration</h3>
            <p><strong>Core Competencies:</strong> Deterministic Schema Engines, Sub-50ms In-Browser Validation, Pydantic v2 Guardrails, REST APIs, Cloudflare Pages &amp; Workers, TypeScript, Python (FastAPI).</p>
            <p class="stack"><strong>Operational Scope:</strong> Eliminating enterprise spreadsheet friction, catalog ingestion latency, and client-side data leaks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Pillar 04: Closed-Loop Control Theory</h3>
            <p><strong>Core Competencies:</strong> State-Space Modeling, Closed-Loop Feedback Stability, Root Locus, Dynamic System Calibration, Transfer Functions, MATLAB, Simulink.</p>
            <p class="stack"><strong>Operational Scope:</strong> Mathematical verification of plant dynamics, state observers, and closed-loop motor/actuator controllers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

