            <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Card A: Finished Goods &amp; BOM Schema Transformation Engine</h3>
            <p class="meta"><a href="https://npl-automation.pages.dev/">https://npl-automation.pages.dev/</a></p>
            <ul class="tight">
              <li>Embedded on-site into high-throughput manufacturing operations (Bommasandra facility) to diagnose and eliminate critical spreadsheet processing bottlenecks between physical production teams and ERP catalogs.</li>
              <li>Engineered a recursive, client-side schema parsing and validation engine running on Cloudflare Pages that turned multi-day reconciliation backlogs into an automated pipeline executing in sub-50ms.</li>
              <li>Enforced strict runtime data types with 100% client-side privacy, eliminating data leakage and human cataloging errors.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="stack" style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Tech Stack:</strong> TypeScript, Cloudflare Pages, Pydantic Schema Principles, Client-Side DOM Engine, REST APIs.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://npl-automation.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open live system ↗</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="tag live">● Live Production Utility</span><span class="tag">&gt;80% Latency Reduction</span>
            <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Card B: Batch Asset Ingestion &amp; Normalization Engine</h3>
            <p class="meta"><a href="https://image-sequence-renamer.pages.dev/">https://image-sequence-renamer.pages.dev/</a></p>
            <ul class="tight">
              <li>Built an in-browser batch processing utility to normalize, sequence, and validate high-volume media asset naming schemas for product cataloging.</li>
