            <p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="https://image-sequence-renamer.pages.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open live utility ↗</a></p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <span class="tag live">● Live Operational Utility</span><span class="tag">Margin Protection Guardrail</span>
            <h3 style="margin-top:12px">Card C: Deterministic Repair Cost Pricing Engine</h3>
            <p class="meta"><a href="https://kshitijsawarkar.github.io/Wakefit_Repair_Calculator/">https://kshitijsawarkar.github.io/Wakefit_Repair_Calculator/</a></p>
            <ul class="tight">
              <li>Translated complex multi-parameter furniture repair and material replacement logic into a deterministic calculation engine.</li>
