            <h3>Block A: Published Edge AI Research (IEEE Xplore)</h3>
            <p class="meta">Published Lead Author | IEEE Xplore | Document ID: 10627276 (Published March 2026)</p>
            <p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Paper Title:</strong> Automated Edge Vision &amp; Retail Checkout System using Quantized YOLOv5 on Embedded Hardware</p>
