            <p>Implemented INT8 Post-Training Quantization via ONNX Runtime to balance activation dynamic ranges, preserving &lt;1% mean Average Precision (mAP) loss while delivering sub-second real-time inference without discrete GPUs.</p>
            <p><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10627276" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Verification Link: ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10627276 ↗</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Block B: Mobile Robotics &amp; Embedded Systems</h3>
            <p><strong>HiWonder MentorPi M1 Autonomous Mobile Robot (ROS2):</strong> Assembled chassis, configured battery management subsystems, and flashed custom Linux kernels on Raspberry Pi 5 under Robot Operating System 2 (ROS2).</p>
            <p>Integrated monocular vision telemetry with SLAM navigation packages for autonomous indoor obstacle avoidance and path planning.</p>
            <p><strong>Sensorless Solar Photovoltaic Tracking System:</strong> Designed a closed-loop solar tracking mechanism utilizing the photovoltaic output voltage of the solar panels themselves to sense light gradients, eliminating fragile external LDR sensors and mechanical failure points.</p>
            <p>Programmed closed-loop servo actuation logic to adjust tracking angle toward maximum power points.</p>
            <p><strong>Hardware-in-the-Loop Simulation &amp; Safety Telemetry:</strong> Built live Wokwi digital twin simulations for Arduino Uno and MQ-2 sensor arrays, implementing interrupt-driven safety interlocks and audio/visual alarm triggers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

